# SHA256 checksums for dataset archives
# Format: <sha256>  <filename>
#
# To generate checksums for your downloaded files:
#   sha256sum /path/to/file >> scripts/dataset_checksums.sha256
#
# Examples (replace with real values):
# abc123...  MH_01_easy.zip
# def456...  tum_vi.tgz
# ghi789...  recording_2021-05-10_19-15-19_imu_gnss.zip
